*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : LON0027
*> PURPOSE : LOAN LIMITS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-07-13 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-08 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 118
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB LONNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0027.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    COPY LON0027C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> MORTGAGE INSURANCE REQUIRED
    05 MI-REQUIRED        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 RATE-ADJUSTMENT    PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM MORTGAGE-INS-CHECK
    DISPLAY "MI-REQUIRED=" MI-REQUIRED
    DISPLAY "RATE-ADJUSTMENT=" RATE-ADJUSTMENT
    STOP RUN.
MORTGAGE-INS-CHECK.
    IF LOAN-TO-VALUE GREATER THAN 85
        MOVE 'Y' TO MI-REQUIRED
        MOVE 0.0050 TO RATE-ADJUSTMENT
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO MI-REQUIRED
    END-IF.
